*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0020
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-06-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-10-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 718
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP050
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0020.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> PRIOR BANKRUPTCY Y/N
    05 BKRPT-IND          PIC X.
    05 YRS-SINCE-BK       PIC 9(2).
    05 CR-SCORE           PIC 9(3).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 CREDIT-DECN        PIC X VALUE 'D'.
    05 REASON-CODE        PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM BANKRUPTCY-CHECK
    DISPLAY "CREDIT-DECN=" CREDIT-DECN
    DISPLAY "REASON-CODE=" REASON-CODE
    STOP RUN.
BANKRUPTCY-CHECK.
    IF BKRPT-IND = 'Y'
        *> RECENT BANKRUPTCY DECLINE
        IF YRS-SINCE-BK < 10
            MOVE 'D' TO CREDIT-DECN
            MOVE 'BK1' TO REASON-CODE
        ELSE
            MOVE 'R' TO CREDIT-DECN
            MOVE 'BK2' TO REASON-CODE
        END-IF
    END-IF.
